# A Vale tapped during an end step changes hands at the next turn's end step, not the current one (CR 603.7b).
[Bot1 Deck]
Rainbow Vale
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Rainbow Vale.Play
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Rainbow Vale.Activate(Color: White)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Rainbow Vale.Tapped = true
[T2 Bot2.End]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Rainbow Vale.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Rainbow Vale = (absent)
